WEBVTT

00:31:29.786 --> 00:31:32.646
it might be some extra
flexibility in hours.

00:31:32.670 --> 00:31:33.993
For a police officer,

00:31:34.017 --> 00:31:37.296
it could be having a say
in which streets to patrol.

00:31:37.320 --> 00:31:38.836
For a retail associate,

00:31:38.860 --> 00:31:42.124
it might be a little discretion
around which products to sell.

00:31:42.870 --> 00:31:45.156
But the demands of some jobs
are so unpredictable

00:31:45.180 --> 00:31:47.646
that control is difficult to offer.

00:31:47.670 --> 00:31:50.725
That's when support
becomes especially important.

00:31:50.749 --> 00:31:55.090
(Fire crackling)

00:31:55.114 --> 00:32:01.726
(Siren blares,
indistinct radio communications)